# Kurn, Son of Mogh (2/3): "Battlefront — Whenever Kurn attacks, you draw X cards and lose X life, where X is the
# number of opponents you attacked this turn" (CR 508.1, 508.3a, 121.1, 119.3). On turn 4 Kurn attacks Bot2 and
# Ornithopter attacks Bot3, so X is 2: Bot1 draws two and loses 2 (at 18). On turn 7 both attack Bot2 alone, so X is 1 -
# the earlier turn's attacks are not this turn's - and Bot1 draws one more and loses 1 (at 17). Two more or fewer would
# fail either life total.

